 "verdict_en": "Partly in place in the HUS university hospital area, which treats Kymenlaakso's patients. Missing: No page we read shows organised transport or a named travel contact for Kymenlaakso lung cancer patients going to HUS. Evidence supports that it works, but not the size of effect we assume. Supported: A northern England registry study (British Journal of Cancer, 2009) found that the furthest-travel group had 0.60 times the odds of lung cancer surgery. Not supported: No study we read shows that travel or hotel support raises the curative-treatment share, let alone by the 1 percentage point we assume.",
 "in_use_label_en": "Partly in place",
 "effect_label_en": "Works, size not shown",
